    <h1 class="msv-hero__title">Property Taxes When Buying in Spain: ITP, VAT, AJD, and More</h1>
    <p class="msv-hero__intro">The purchase price of a Spanish property is only part of what you'll pay. Buyers typically pay an additional 10–14% in taxes, fees, and costs on top of the agreed price. Understanding these costs before you make an offer is essential — they can significantly affect your budget.</p>
  </div>
